# key-ring: from the menu, load the saved game setup/key-ring writes (facing the locked door at
# (36, 8), lock 1, with a key for lock 1 and a key for lock 2 in the pack); use the key for
# lock 2 on the door twice (left button on the key, right button on the door). With the flag
# the first use unlocks the door with the key for lock 1 ("Another key unlocks the lock.") and
# the second locks it again ("Another key locks the lock."); the original says "The key does
# not fit." to both
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
7000 move 268 92       # the key for lock 2, used on the door
7300 mdown 268 92 left
7600 mup 268 92 left
8800 move 140 90
9100 mdown 140 90 right
9400 mup 140 90 right
11000 move 268 92      # and again
11300 mdown 268 92 left
11600 mup 268 92 left
12800 move 140 90
13100 mdown 140 90 right
13400 mup 140 90 right
